@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.KopiCintaGoesToRanzModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Kopi Cinta Goes to Ranz";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <!-- HERO -->
        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Collaborations & Campaigns</p>
                <h2>Kopi Cinta Goes to RANS Carnival Malang</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A moment to be seen — where Kopi Cinta stepped into a wider public space
                    and shared its experience with more people than ever before.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Public Event</span>
                    <span>Brand Exposure</span>
                    <span>Meaningful Interaction</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="event-hero-img">
                <img src="/images/ranz/25.jpg" alt="Raffi Ahmad visiting Kopi Cinta at RANS Carnival">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- INTRO STORY -->
        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">A Moment to Be Seen</p>
                <h3>More Than Just a Booth</h3>

                <p>
                    There are moments when a journey begins to be seen by more people.
                    For us, one of those moments happened when we joined RANS Carnival in Malang.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Among various booths of local businesses, food, drinks, and games,
                    we brought Kopi Cinta as a small space offering something different.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We were not there just to sell, but to share an experience.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>What We Brought</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Kopi Cinta signature drinks</li>
                    <li>Merchandise that carried our story</li>
                    <li>Sign language ordering experience</li>
                    <li>A new way for people to connect</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        

        <!-- STORY SECTION 1 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/ranz/23.jpg" alt="">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>A Different Way to Order</h3>
                <p>
                    As always, we invited everyone to order using sign language,
                    with simple tutorials provided on the spot.
                </p>
                <p>
                    In the middle of the crowd, many meaningful interactions happened —
                    curiosity, laughter, and the joy of trying a new way to communicate
                    for the first time.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY SECTION 2 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reverse reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/ranz/raffi.jpg" alt="">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>A Memorable Highlight</h3>
                <p>
                    One of the most memorable moments of the event was when
                    Raffi Ahmad visited our booth.
                </p>
                <p>
                    From that point, Kopi Cinta began to reach a wider audience —
                    allowing our story to be known by more people.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="featured-grid reveal">
            <img src="/images/ranz/2.jpg" alt="">
            <img src="/images/ranz/3.jpg" alt="">
            <img src="/images/ranz/4.jpg" alt="">
        </div>

        <!-- STORY SECTION 3 -->
        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Beyond Exposure</p>
                <h3>It Was About the Experience</h3>
                <p>
                    For us, being part of RANS Carnival was not just about exposure.
                    It was about the experience.
                </p>
                <p>
                    It was a moment where our team could engage directly,
                    learn, adapt, and grow through a new environment.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">What We Brought Home</p>
                <h3>More Than Results</h3>
                <p>
                    From the event, we brought home something more than just results.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We carried back a meaningful experience — one that will stay with us
                    as part of our journey moving forward.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ENDING -->
        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Sharing CINTA with More People</h3>
            <p>
                In the end, every small step we take brings us closer
                to sharing CINTA with more people.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- GALLERY -->
        <div class="detail-section reveal">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Event Gallery</h3>

            <div class="gallery-grid">
                @for (int i = 2; i <= 30; i++)
                {
                    <img src="/images/ranz/@(i).jpg" class="gallery-img" alt="">
                }
            </div>
        </div>
        <br>
        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Collaborations</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>